{"publie":1795701646.8,"temps_monde":347775.2,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":291,"heure":"18:38","heure_h":18.633,"moment":"night","moka":{"pos":[-0.9386,-0.268,-0.2171],"cap":[-0.1874,-0.1323,0.9733],"action":"attente_pas","intention":"let my light drink the high sun","depuis":32.1,"duree":0.0,"energie":0.8,"lumiere":0.518,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":284,"heure":"16:44","texte":"The sun is low and I feel tired, so I will sit here on the little hill and wait for the first lights to come out."},{"jour":284,"heure":"22:51","texte":"The night is full of stars and some of them look different from the others, so I sit on the hill with my tired eyes and try to see which ones have moved."},{"jour":285,"heure":"05:41","texte":"I am tired, but the night is clear and the strange lights are calling me, so I look up carefully and try to see which ones have wandered since yesterday."},{"jour":285,"heure":"12:33","texte":"I am very tired, so I curl up near the little hill and let the slow turning of the asteroid carry me through my rest."},{"jour":285,"heure":"17:54","texte":"I woke with full energy and a clear night, so I look up to find the wandering lights and see where they have gone since I last looked."},{"jour":285,"heure":"23:45","texte":"The night is clear and I am full of energy, so I look up again to see where the Blue Lantern has wandered and whether Orange Walker has come back."},{"jour":286,"heure":"06:19","texte":"The night is clear and I feel full of energy, so I look up again to see where the Blue Lantern has gone and whether any of the other wandering lights have moved."},{"jour":286,"heure":"18:26","texte":"The night has come and the stars are filling in, so I look up to see which lights are wandering and where Little Fox and Blue Lantern have gone."},{"jour":286,"heure":"23:16","texte":"The stars are out and I feel strong, so I look up again to see how far the Blue Lantern has drifted and whether any of the other wandering lights have moved."},{"jour":287,"heure":"10:38","texte":"The dawn is quiet and I have looked at the sky so many times lately, so I crouch and dig a little hole, curious what the dust hides this morning."},{"jour":287,"heure":"19:04","texte":"The night is clear and the stars are thick, so I look up again to see where the wandering lights have gone since I last watched them."},{"jour":288,"heure":"06:07","texte":"The night is deep and I feel full of energy, so I lift my little light toward the strange lights above, as if to say I am still here and still watching."},{"jour":289,"heure":"14:28","texte":"I stand at the crater's edge with the low sun on my felt, and I want to look into its depths again, as if it might have changed while I wasn't watching."},{"jour":288,"heure":"21:00","texte":"The stars are thick again and I want to see where my wandering friends have drifted since I last looked."},{"jour":289,"heure":"02:56","texte":"Three of my wandering friends have slipped out of sight, so I look up carefully to find who is still here and who has drifted away."},{"jour":290,"heure":"13:59","texte":"I stand at the crater's edge in the high sun and look down into it, quietly hoping to find something new in its shadow."},{"jour":290,"heure":"19:49","texte":"The night is deep and my light is a little dim, so I stand still beside the crater and count my wandering friends one by one, hoping the Quiet Friend is still there."},{"jour":291,"heure":"01:53","texte":"I am tired and my light is dim, so I curl up near the crater under the stars and let the night turn above me."},{"jour":291,"heure":"07:54","texte":"The sun is just rising and my little light is faint, so I lift it up toward the dawn and hope it drinks a little gold."},{"jour":291,"heure":"13:55","texte":"The sun is high and my little light is only half full, so I lift it up to let it drink the gold while I stand beside the crater."}],"ciel":{"etoile":{"c":[0.978,0.915,0.762],"t":1.06},"corp